    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the thrilling Striker Zone \u2013 a cross-platform shooter game where heroism meets the heat of battle. Engage in heart-pounding warfare with soldiers from around the globe, each moment packed with adrenaline and the echo of gunfire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/4dbe50cbfbfcd9424420be7bf65574ff.poster.avif?t=1750071333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/4dbe50cbfbfcd9424420be7bf65574ff.webm?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/4dbe50cbfbfcd9424420be7bf65574ff.mp4?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Striker Zone, you are more than a soldier; you're a modern warrior, a hero poised to strike in the zone where war never ends. Your arsenal? A range of free, state-of-the-art weapons at your fingertips. Every battle is a chance to rewrite history in this world of constant war, where your army comrades become your brethren in arms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/a8faf333ba6cdfbd3b420c6f00066ab3.poster.avif?t=1750071333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/a8faf333ba6cdfbd3b420c6f00066ab3.webm?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/a8faf333ba6cdfbd3b420c6f00066ab3.mp4?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlefields come to life with the sound of shooting and the rush of survival instincts. Attack is more than a strategy; it's your second nature, honed to perfection in the zone where only the strongest persist. And as the gun smoke clears, will you stand as the ultimate survivor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/47f673026eb39a478c93f80ded40842e.poster.avif?t=1750071333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/47f673026eb39a478c93f80ded40842e.webm?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/47f673026eb39a478c93f80ded40842e.mp4?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's essence is warfare, but the experience is pure adrenaline. Striker Zone offers a free PvP environment that challenges your shooter instincts at every turn. Each battle, each skirmish, each silent takedown could tip the scales in this relentless world war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every fight, you climb the ranks of the army elite, proving your mettle as a soldier, hero, and legend of the Striker Zone. Your weapon is not just a gun; it's an extension of your will, modern machinery of warfare that brings the concept of attack to a whole new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, prepare to immerse yourself in Striker Zone, where the action never stops and the next battle is just a heartbeat away. Will you answer the call of duty and become the hero this world needs?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the thrilling Striker Zone \u2013 a cross-platform shooter game where heroism meets the heat of battle. Engage in heart-pounding warfare with soldiers from around the globe, each moment packed with adrenaline and the echo of gunfire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/4dbe50cbfbfcd9424420be7bf65574ff.poster.avif?t=1750071333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/4dbe50cbfbfcd9424420be7bf65574ff.webm?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/4dbe50cbfbfcd9424420be7bf65574ff.mp4?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Striker Zone, you are more than a soldier; you're a modern warrior, a hero poised to strike in the zone where war never ends. Your arsenal? A range of free, state-of-the-art weapons at your fingertips. Every battle is a chance to rewrite history in this world of constant war, where your army comrades become your brethren in arms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/a8faf333ba6cdfbd3b420c6f00066ab3.poster.avif?t=1750071333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/a8faf333ba6cdfbd3b420c6f00066ab3.webm?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/a8faf333ba6cdfbd3b420c6f00066ab3.mp4?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlefields come to life with the sound of shooting and the rush of survival instincts. Attack is more than a strategy; it's your second nature, honed to perfection in the zone where only the strongest persist. And as the gun smoke clears, will you stand as the ultimate survivor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/47f673026eb39a478c93f80ded40842e.poster.avif?t=1750071333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/47f673026eb39a478c93f80ded40842e.webm?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430370/extras/47f673026eb39a478c93f80ded40842e.mp4?t=1750071333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's essence is warfare, but the experience is pure adrenaline. Striker Zone offers a free PvP environment that challenges your shooter instincts at every turn. Each battle, each skirmish, each silent takedown could tip the scales in this relentless world war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every fight, you climb the ranks of the army elite, proving your mettle as a soldier, hero, and legend of the Striker Zone. Your weapon is not just a gun; it's an extension of your will, modern machinery of warfare that brings the concept of attack to a whole new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, prepare to immerse yourself in Striker Zone, where the action never stops and the next battle is just a heartbeat away. Will you answer the call of duty and become the hero this world needs?</p>",
